OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom 17th December 1973 until early
OL,7,FFebruary 1974, all three channels had
OL,8,Fto close down by 10.30pm.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIn practice, the closedown times were
OL,11,Fstaggered to avoid the risk of a power
OL,12,Fsurge.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe BBC's networks closed at 10.20pm
OL,15,Fsome nights ` ITV curtailed News at Ten
OL,16,Fon the others.
OL,17,
OL,18,FThe early closedown caused broadcasters
OL,19,Fnightmares.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12903
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F129A1768739869
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                  G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FLate evening programmes either had to
OL,7,Fbe abandoned completely or rescheduled
OL,8,Fin earlier slots.
OL,9,
OL,10,FSome BBC programmes which were due to
OL,11,Fbe shown at 9.25pm, such as certain
OL,12,Feditions of Play for Today, had to be
OL,13,Fdropped as they would not be finished
OL,14,Fby 10.30pm.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThe loss of late evening advertising
OL,17,Fwas a blow to ITV.
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
