OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe row over the early closedowns was
OL,7,Fexplored in an article in The Stage `
OL,8,Fthe newspaper of the entertainment
OL,9,Findustry ` in January 1974.
OL,10,
OL,11,FShutdown saving a million units a day
OL,12,
OL,13,FThe question whether the saving of
OL,14,Felectricity by the early closedown of
OL,15,Ftelevision was worthwhile was raised by
OL,16,FMr Peter Shore (Lab, Stepney) in a
OL,17,Fquestion in Parliament to Mr Peter
OL,18,FEmery, Under Secretary of State for
OL,19,FIndustry.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12905
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F129A1768739869
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                  G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FMr Shore wanted to know what estimate
OL,7,Fhad been made of the amount of
OL,8,Felectricity saved by the restrictions
OL,9,Fon programmes. He also asked what
OL,10,Fpercentage this represented of normal
OL,11,Felectricity consumption at the relevant
OL,12,Ftime.
OL,13,
OL,14,FMr Emery said he estimated that the
OL,15,Fsaving of electricity arising from the
OL,16,Fswitching off of television sets at
OL,17,F10.30pm amounted to one million units a
OL,18,Fday, which was equivalent to two per
OL,19,Fcent of the normal usage during the
OL,20,Flast 1.5 hours of the day.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12906
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F129A1768739869
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                  G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In the present critical situation it
OL,7,Fis important that every possible saving
OL,8,Fof electricity should be found." Mr
OL,9,FEmery added, "and I urge everyone to
OL,10,Fexercise the utmost economy in its
OL,11,Fuse."
OL,12,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12907
